+---
+id: task-003-correct-order-discounts-coupon-expiry-and-shipping-vat
+type: task
+title: "Correct order discounts, coupon expiry and shipping VAT"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Resolve three reported order-service defects while preserving integer-cent rounding and existing service boundaries:
+
+- Apply a percentage coupon to the subtotal after volume discounts, so twelve €5.00 notebooks with a 10% coupon cost €48.60 in goods.
+- Treat a coupon's `validUntil` date as inclusive, so AUTUMN remains valid through 30 November.
+- Stop charging VAT on shipping and update receipts and business-rule documentation to show no VAT on delivery.
+
+Add regression coverage for each report and run the existing test suite.
